url: "https://github.com/pyjavo/comparativas-deep-learning-reconocimiento-kanji-japoneses"
abstract: >-
  Source code and experimental configurations comparing five deep convolutional
  neural network architectures (VGG16, VGG19, DenseNet121, ResNet50, and
  ResNet152V2) for offline handwritten Japanese Kanji character recognition
  across ETL-8G and ETL-9G datasets, varying image dimensions, background color
  inversion, and Otsu thresholding.
